ent": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.\n", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 11, "stimuli_ids": []}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le07ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le07ob10re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn10le07ob10re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn10le07ob10re2img01.jpg", "text": "Dear Candice, <br/> <br/>As requested, here is a short progress report from our home base here in Lesotho. We've been going at a breakneck pace. In fact, I'm scribbling this missive on a piece of paper on a bus. I'll have one of our aides type it up and send it to you later this afternoon. We've had a few small setbacks. The groundbreaking ceremony for the medical center was supposed to have occurred on Saturday. There was a torrential rain; the site was a bit soggy, so we moved it to the following Tuesday. We didn't have to postpone, but we thought it wise under the circumstances.", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn10le07ob10re2img02.jpg", "text": "Samuel was really instrumental in making it a success. He got the workers to completely drain the site so that we could set up some chairs for the press. We really needn't worry about the future of the projects with him around! The pictures appeared in the local paper the next day, and hopefully we generated a little awareness and goodwill within the community. I'll have them included in the package so that we can use them in our fundraising efforts back home.", "time": "37000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn10le07ob10re2img05.jpg", "text": "After the launch, Samuel and I had the driver take us to two different foster homes. What a heartwarming experience! The children don't have a lot of modern amenities, but they make due with their limited resources. It just goes to show you that we don't have to have all of our modern toys and technologies in order to find a bit of contentment. <br/><br/>Well, I don't have to tell you that time flies around here, so I'll say goodbye for now. <br/><br/>Thank you for giving me the opportunity to live my values! <br/><br/>Amy Watson", "time": "63000", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}